{
  "name": "Garage Quote Agent · 03 Follow-ups",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 · Follow-ups\nEvery hour: finds estimates that were not booked and are due a reminder.\n- **WhatsApp:** one reminder, inside the 24-hour window that opens when the customer writes. Later messages would need Meta-approved templates (planned).\n- **Email:** up to two reminders, only if the customer ticked consent.\n\nAfter the last reminder the lead is marked **lost_no_reply**, so the weekly report shows real drop-off.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 260,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d19d2858-c19a-7847-96fd-6db6a9b2e30a",
      "name": "About",
